value.CLOUD_MODE.1=Volumetric
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE=Cloud Coverage
option.CLOUD_COVERAGE.comment=How much of the sky the clouds fill. This changes cloud fraction, not brightness: it moves the threshold the density noise has to cross.
